                                    name: "DICE_CERTIFCATES",
                                    absorb: true,
                                    desc: '''
                                          DICE certificate chain endorsing the secure boot stages following UDS:
                                          (Owner Intermediate (CDI_0), Silicon Owner (CDI_1), ...). Certificates
                                          are variable length and stored without any zero-padding in between.

                                          The certificates may be updated in-field to correspond to changes to
                                          chip state modifiable post-provisioning, such as the silicon creator
                                          firmware.
